# =============================================================================
#  BACKEND build konteksti filtri
# =============================================================================
#  Docker `docker build` boshlanishida BUTUN kontekstni (backend/ papkasini)
#  demon'ga arxivlab yuboradi. Bu ro'yxatdagi narsalar yuborilmaydi.
#
#  IKKI SABAB:
#   1) TEZLIK — bin/ va obj/ yuzlab megabayt bo'lishi mumkin.
#   2) TO'G'RILIK — host'dagi obj/ ichida MUTLAQ YO'LLAR va host platformasi
#      uchun yig'ilgan asset'lar bor. Ular konteynerga tushsa,
#      "Assets file /Users/... not found" degan chalg'ituvchi xato chiqadi.
#      Bu — Docker'dagi .NET build'ining ENG KO'P uchraydigan muammosi.
# =============================================================================

# --- .NET qurilish natijalari (eng muhim qismi) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/
*.user
*.suo

# --- Testlar ---
# Prod image'ga test loyihalari kerak emas. Dockerfile ularni baribir
# ko'chirmaydi (faqat src/ dagi 4 ta .csproj), lekin kontekstni
# yengillashtirish uchun bu yerda ham to'samiz.
tests/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage*.xml
**/*.trx

# --- Git va IDE ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.DS_Store

# --- Sirlar: HECH QACHON image ichiga tushmasin (SPEC 9.8) ---
# Image qatlamlari o'chirilmaydi: keyingi qatlamda `rm` qilsangiz ham
# fayl oldingi qatlamda QOLADI va uni chiqarib olish mumkin.
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json

# --- Docker fayllarining o'zi ---
# Dockerfile o'zgarishi kesh yaroqsizligiga sabab bo'lmasin.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# --- Hujjatlar ---
**/*.md
